From cd3737746d4a5d61682ab459c9e3dff293441799 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 09:29:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf+fix: zone World init 100 s (was >10 min); leaves-zone by
 whole-DB spawns; level cap 13 (F-219)

- summoners(): one indexed DBC query for "spells that summon X" (182 per-entry queries = 67 s)
- leaves_zone: an objective target (or every dropper of an objective item) that spawns somewhere
  but never inside the box - catches Westfall/Stockade/Scarlet Monastery quests from Stormwind,
  whose spawns lie beyond the 1200 yd loaded for objectives (Elwynn: 16 -> 84 flagged)
- quests above level 13 are out of a starting-zone run (Stormwind hands out level 20-60 quests);
  Alterac Valley's sort joins the PvP list

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
---
 zeppelin/tests/start_area.py | 72 +++++++++++++++++++++---------------
 1 file changed, 43 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

